{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T14:29:52.958Z","entries":{"docs-7.24\u0000## system/package/apply-changes **Type:** Command":"## system/package/apply-changes \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## system/package/enable **Type:** Command":"## system/package/enable \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## system/package/local-update **Type:** Directory":"## system/package/local-update \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## system/package/local-update/download **Type:** Command":"## system/package/local-update/download \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## system/package/local-update/download-all **Type:** Command":"## system/package/local-update/download-all \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## system/package/local-update/mirror **Type:** Settings Directory":"## system/package/local-update/mirror \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.24\u0000## system/package/local-update/mirror/force-check **Type:** Command":"## system/package/local-update/mirror/force-check \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## system/package/local-update/refresh **Type:** Command":"## system/package/local-update/refresh \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## system/package/local-update/update-package-source **Type:** Directory":"## system/package/local-update/update-package-source \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## system/package/uninstall **Type:** Command":"## system/package/uninstall \n**类型：** Command","docs-7.24\u0000## system/package/unschedule **Type:** Command":"## system/package/unschedule \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## system/package/update/cancel **Type:** Command":"## system/package/update/cancel \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## system/package/update/download **Type:** Command":"## system/package/update/download \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## system/package/update/install **Type:** Command":"## system/package/update/install \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000Apply scheduled changes and reboot the device.":"应用已计划的更改并重启设备。","docs-7.24\u0000Download all compatible(matching device architecture) packages that are available on the local package server. Downloaded packages are saved in the root directory.":"下载本地软件包服务器上所有可用且兼容（匹配设备架构）的软件包。下载的软件包保存在根目录。","docs-7.24\u0000Download specific compatible(matching device architecture) packages that are available on the local package server. Downloaded packages are saved in the root directory.":"下载本地软件包服务器上可用的、与设备架构匹配的特定兼容软件包。下载的软件包保存在根目录。","docs-7.24\u0000Instead of connecting directly to MikroTik servers, you can upload package files to one of your local RouterOS devices and use it as a local package server.":"无需直接连接到 MikroTik 服务器，你可以将软件包文件上传到一台本地 RouterOS 设备，并将其用作本地软件包服务器。","docs-7.24\u0000Refresh and check the list of available compatible(matching device architecture) packages on the local package server.":"刷新并检查本地软件包服务器上可用的兼容（匹配设备架构）软件包列表。","docs-7.24\u0000Schedule the package to be removed from the router. That will take place during the reboot.":"安排从路由器移除软件包。该操作将在重启期间执行。","docs-7.24\u0000The server from which to get the package is defined in this list.":"此列表定义从中获取软件包的服务器。","docs-7.24\u0000You can mirror packages(for all architectures) from your main local package server by using this menu. Downloaded packages are saved into the `packs` folder in the root directory.":"使用该菜单可以从主本地软件包服务器镜像软件包（适用于所有架构）。下载的软件包会保存到根目录中的 `packs` 文件夹。"}}
